DESCRIPTION:Topic\n\n:\n\nSmart Investment for Wealth Accumulation in DBS (
	Hong Kong)\n\nSynopsis\n\n:\n\nThis webinar aims to share some investment 
	concepts\, especially importance of diversification. It will cover hints o
	n selecting funds\, exclusive staff offers\, portfolio building skills\, a
	nd how technology can improve the investment journey. The program will als
	o explore ESG investing and yield-enhancing products\, particularly releva
	nt after the Fed rate hike. Attendees will gain valuable insights to make 
	informed investment decisions.\n\nSpeakers\n\n:\n\nWinson Yau\n\nTeam Head
	\, Treasures Investment Counsellor\, CBG\n\n \n\n\n\n_____________________
	__________________________________________________________________________
	_______________\n\nOption 1 – If you are joining via a laptop or mobile 
	device through the application:\n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webex Meeting
	 Link <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=m913259d4fe6ee9a04c6f24963b972
	f89> \n2. Use a headset for a better experience\n*Visit here <https://dbs1
	bank.sharepoint.com/sites/sgFOW/SitePages/fow/digital-tools.aspx?market=Si
	ngapore&category=Communication> to find out more about Webex \n\nMeeting p
	assword: aQ48KmKCTJ4 (only if asked)\n\nOption 2 – If you are joining vi
	a Cisco VC Equipment:\nUse the Touch Panel to dial in\n1. Press the "Call"
	 icon\n2. Dial 25153632243@dbs.webex.com <mailto:25153632243@dbs.webex.com
	>  into the search bar and press "Call" \n3. If you are the host\, enter y
	our 6-digit one-time Host KEY. Click here to see how to retrieve your Host
	 KEY <https://dbs1bank.sharepoint.com/sites/sgFOW/Shared%20Documents/Forms
	/AllItems.aspx?viewpath=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents&id=%2Fsites%
	2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FGuides%2FWebEx%2FUser%20Guide%5FHost%5FPIN%
	2Epdf&viewid=1b23a731%2D8c47%2D42f0%2Dbd84%2Db790e52deffa&parent=%2Fsites%
	2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FGuides%2FWebEx> \n\nOption 3 – If you are
	 joining via a laptop through the Web browser: \nFor external parties who 
	do not wish to download the application \n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webe
	x Meeting Link <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=m913259d4fe6ee9a04c6f
	24963b972f89> \n2. Click on ‘Cancel button’ if a popup ‘Open Webex?'
	 appears \n3. Click on ‘Join from your browser’ \n4. Enter your Name a
	nd Email Address and join the meeting \n\nClick here <https://help.webex.c
	om/en-us/article/nrbgeodb/Join-a-Webex-Meeting#id_135013> to find out more
	\n\nOption 4 – If you are dialling in via phone (audio only):\n*Toll cha
	rges / Long distance charges may apply.\nNote if you are the host\, please
	 use either Option 1 or 2 to start the meeting.\nSingapore +65-3157-6442 <
	tel:%2B65-3157-6442\,\,1%23\,%23> \nHong Kong +852-3018-6828 <tel:%2B852-3
	018-6828\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Mumbai +91-22-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-22-648
	0-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Hyderabad +91-40-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-40-64
	80-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nTaiwan +886-2-5594-0839 <tel:%2B886-2-5594-0839\,\
	,1%23\,%23> \n\nMeeting Number: 2515 363 2243#\nGlobal call-in numbers <ht
	tps://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php> \n\n\nUseful Links:\nNeed help? 
	Contact Webex Support Team! <mailto:webexsupport@dbs.com> \n\n \n\n
